---

<section id="rules-section" class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 mt-12 mb-8">
  <div class="vercel-card rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col gap-6">
    
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-zinc-800 pb-4">
      <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">Rules & Origins</span>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
        About Online Hex Board Game (Hexxagon)
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Hexxagon is an iconic strategy board game invented in 1993 by Software Creations. Played on a tessellated hexagonal grid, it challenges players to clone, leap, and infect adjacent opposing tokens.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Core Mechanics Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs text-zinc-300">
      
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/60 border border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 text-sm font-bold font-mono">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Cell Duplication</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          Moving 1 distance to an adjacent hex clones your piece, adding an additional friendly token to the board without sacrificing the original.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/60 border border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-sm font-bold font-mono">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Tactical Leap</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          Jumping 2 distances teleports your piece to an open hex across enemy lines, vacating the initial position for surprise offensive strikes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/60 border border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col gap-2">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-400 text-sm font-bold font-mono">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Infection Cascade</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          When landing, all enemy pieces touching the target destination are converted to your color instantly, triggering massive point swings.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
